## 🛠️ Verification Commands

You can run the FastAPI server to test the consolidated endpoint directly:
```powershell
uv run uvicorn src.main:app --reload
```

Send a request without a `thread_id` to start a thread:
```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:8000/request" -ContentType "application/json" -Body '{"text": "Mujhe AC repairing chahiye G-13 mein"}'
```

And continue the same conversation by supplying the returned `task_id` in the next request body:
```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:8000/request" -ContentType "application/json" -Body '{"text": "Yes please, confirm booking", "thread_id": "YOUR_TASK_ID_HERE"}'
```
